# ── Static corpus (FolioChunks — baked, read-only) ─────────────────────────
# Points Prisma to db/custom.db. In serverless, static-db.ts copies this
# to /tmp/kalki-corpus.db at cold start. DO NOT write to this file at runtime.
DATABASE_URL=file:/home/z/my-project/db/custom.db

# ── Dynamic runtime DB (Users, Streaks, Keys) ───────────────────────────
# When these are set, db.ts connects to Turso via @prisma/adapter-libsql.
# When absent (local dev), falls back to DATABASE_URL (local SQLite).
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://kalki-mirror-xxx.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-turso-auth-token
